A||||6||GT Bastard||Some punks in an RX-7.....||||3||
Z||000000||GT Bastard||08-11-2000||11:31 PM||||Once again, driving home from work, minding my own business at 12:20am in the morning.  A late 80's/early 90's Black RX7 screams up from behind to land next to me at a stop light. Intersection is clear, nobody in front or immediately behind us.  Couple of "Slim Shady's" in an RX7 are snickering at my plastic car whilst revving their car into oblivion.  I flog the Fiero, and she growls with delight.  Green light, slip the clutch at 1600rpm.  This RX7 is screaming beside me.  Crossing the intersection I've got a good car-length on him but no more... I didn't want to race into second gear for fear of letting it get dangerous or getting caught, but it would have been interesting.  Lucky for me, she still hasn't spun her bearing(makes some bad noises), but I get a little smoke on acceleration.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  Waiting on the machine shop to get my block back! <P>------------------<BR>Gold 86 SE V6 4-sp w/4.10 gears, Eibach springs, Koni's all around w/some poly bushings<BR>Yoko's<BR>Coated headers<BR>ACT 4-puck clutch<BR>MSD ignition<BR>Flowmaster w/ mandrel bent 2.5 pipe<BR>extrude honed intake<BR>Lots of fuel system mods... etc etc...||||reg||3
Z||000001||olympic||08-11-2000||11:44 PM||||Nice kill GT!!!!<P>   Check out this kill story.  <A HREF="http://www.ls6.com/ubb/Forum48/HTML/000793.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.ls6.com/ubb/Forum48/HTML/000793.html</A> <P>This guy should write this stuff for a living.  I felt like I was right there in the passenger seat.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>"Those who can,  do.  Those who can't,  teach."||||reg||1
Z||000002||1FST2M6||08-12-2000||10:01 AM||||YEAH! you don't have to KILL them just toss doubt into their mind and they'll wonder for ever..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">   hurry the machine shop up!! that smoke is the WAY OVER FUELing... that what it shows on the dyno... everone elses car boggles on WOT that one doesn't.. ||||reg||1
Z||000003||FieroMike||08-14-2000||06:45 PM||||That's not a kill.  Racing someone in first gear doesn't mean anything.  Take an Elcipse AWD turbo and Race an LS1 cam/bird.  They will beat them off the line everytime.  Do you think they are faster??? Should have at least went to 60.||||reg||6
Z||000004||1FST2M6||08-14-2000||08:22 PM||||1st gear is 38mph... in about 2 seconds... 2nd is about 54 about 3 seconds more... chirp into 3rd about a sec later your @ 62 the 4:10 with nice torque numbers helps LAUNCH the car... just wish those #^%@% headers actuall helped..  only 6% gain in HP and 3% loss in torque at peaks and larger drops getting there... AAAAAH i'm still mad about that   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif"> ... sorry Jeff.. ||||reg||1
Z||000005||GT Bastard||08-15-2000||12:01 AM||||I enjoy racing to higher speeds but it doesn't work out very well around town...  And it's dangerous.  That's why my only races are at night on unoccupied roads.  I've raced two other Fiero's from a dead stop to 90+ and didn't have a problem beating them.  One was a good friends '86SE 3.1 V6, and the other was a midly built '86GT 3.1 stroker.  Both were 4-spd's.  <P>Trav, sucks about the headers but they sure do look nice!  Hopefully the 3.2 will make better use of them.||||reg||1
Z||000006||1FST2M6||08-15-2000||12:34 PM||||THEY BETTER help on a bigger motor!! there a Dynojet dyno near you Jeff? I can arrange for it to be a comped run, once you get the new motor in...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> pretty sad that a tuned 2.8 will pull a 3.1.... ||||reg||1
